# 🛍️ YHTENÄINEN SEO SNIPPETS PAKETTI - SHOPIFY VALMIS

## 1️⃣ **snippets/seo-snippets.liquid**

```liquid
{%- comment -%} === 1) BREADCRUMBLIST JSON-LD (Home → Collection → Tagit) === {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if template.name contains 'collection' -%}
  {%- capture _crumbs -%}
  [
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ shop.url }}"},
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"{{ collection.title | escape }}","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"}
    {%- if current_tags.size > 0 -%}
    ,{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"{{ current_tags | join: ', ' | escape }}","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"}
    {%- endif -%}
  ]
  {%- endcapture -%}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":{{ _crumbs | strip }}}
  </script>
{%- elsif template.name == 'product' -%}
  {%- assign _coll = product.collections.first -%}
  {%- if _coll -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[
      {"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ shop.url }}"},
      {"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"{{ _coll.title | escape }}","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ _coll.url }}"},
      {"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"{{ product.title | escape }}","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}"}
    ]}
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} === 2) KANONISOINTI + NOINDEX FILTTEREILLE (tagit ja ?constraints=…) === {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign _has_constraints = request.query_string contains 'constraints=' -%}
{%- if template.name contains 'collection' -%}
  {%- if current_tags.size > 0 or _has_constraints -%}
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}">
    {%- if current_tags.size > 1 or _has_constraints and request.query_string contains '%2B' -%}
      <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%} hreflang kokoelmaan (perus-URL) {%- endcomment -%}
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fi" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.fi }}{{ collection.url }}">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.en }}{{ collection.url }}">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.ru }}{{ collection.url }}">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}">
{%- endif -%}

